---
source: crates/daemon/tests/integration/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Send an item to Marginalia, or find it there if it was sent before. A digest link's article is fetched first when it isn't saved. --dry-run names what would be sent and where, and contacts nothing

Usage: mxr reading marginalia send [OPTIONS] <ITEM>

Arguments:
  <ITEM>

Options:
      --dry-run
      --open               Open it in Marginalia afterwards
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
